---
title: Deadlines
description: Upcoming submission deadlines and events for programming languages and formal methods venues.
eleventyNavigation:
  key: Deadlines
  order: 5
---
{% css %}
.deadlines .countdown {
	white-space: nowrap;
	font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
	opacity: 0.75;
}
.deadlines small {
	opacity: 0.75;
}
{% endcss %}

<div class="deadlines">

<h1>Deadlines</h1>

{% set errors = deadlines.errors %}{% include "build-errors.njk" %}

<table>
	<thead>
		<tr><th>Conference</th><th>Deadline</th><th>What</th><th>Event</th></tr>
	</thead>
	<tbody>
	{%- for row in deadlines.conferences %}
		<tr>
			<td><a href="{{ row.url }}">{{ row.conf }}</a></td>
			<td>{{ row.deadline | readableDate("dd LLL yyyy", "UTC-12") }} <span class="countdown" data-deadline="{{ row.deadlineISO }}"></span></td>
			<td>{{ row.comment }}</td>
			<td>{{ row.when }}{% if row.place %}<br><small>{{ row.place }}</small>{% endif %}</td>
		</tr>
	{%- endfor %}
	</tbody>
</table>

<h2>Upcoming events</h2>

<table>
	<thead>
		<tr><th>Event</th><th>When</th><th>Where</th></tr>
	</thead>
	<tbody>
	{%- for row in deadlines.upcoming %}
		<tr>
			<td><a href="{{ row.url }}">{{ row.conf }}</a></td>
			<td>{{ row.when }}</td>
			<td>{{ row.place }}</td>
		</tr>
	{%- endfor %}
	</tbody>
</table>

<p><small>
Deadlines are end of day, Anywhere on Earth. List built {{ deadlines.generated | readableDate("dd LLL yyyy", "UTC-12") }} and refreshed weekly from
<a href="https://pl-conferences.com/">PL Conferences</a>; countdowns are live.
</small></p>

</div>

{% js %}
for (const el of document.querySelectorAll(".deadlines [data-deadline]")) {
	const days = Math.ceil((Date.parse(el.dataset.deadline) - Date.now()) / 86400000);
	el.textContent = days < 0 ? "(passed)" : days === 0 ? "(today)" : `(in ${days} day${days === 1 ? "" : "s"})`;
}
{% endjs %}
